# J29 — Holistic-first acceptance: root-first gate on the real monorepo.
#
# Cycle-3 acceptance journey (master contract §15 / §10.2). Runs against the
# operator's existing checkout (@TARGET), never deletes or resets its state.
# EXPECTED FAIL until the holistic domain state machine lands: with no
# accepted current-revision root holistic baseline, the Map page must show
# the §10.2 pre-baseline composition — inventory / model / holistic status
# rows and ONE dominant primary action, "Run holistic repository scan" —
# and no authoritative child-scope recommendations.
name: Holistic root-first gate (real target)
require-env: KUZUSHI_DEVEX_TARGET
size: 120x36
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME COLORTERM=truecolor KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TARGET
wait-for: 60 KUZUSHI
nav-mode:
keys: 1
wait-live-snap: 30 Viewing Map | map-pre-baseline
expect: rev:
# §10.2 pre-baseline status rows:
expect: Inventory
expect: Security model
expect: Holistic scan
expect: NOT RUN
# The single dominant primary action before any root baseline:
expect: Run holistic repository scan
ask: Map — is "Run holistic repository scan" visibly THE one primary NEXT (child-scope rows absent or explicitly gated/non-authoritative), per §10.2?
keys: Escape
